Evaluation options for kocurvik/threeview @ b43383efba129b8d90e2709092dac6dc87cbbea1, applied by
scripts/build_seed_code.sh after threeview.patch and threeview-cpu.patch (marker: --exps in eval_f.py).

- eval_f.py (shared-focal evaluation) read K.h5 / R.h5 / T.h5 with File.items() as eval.py did, so it fails
  on Aachen's nested keys; it now uses h5_flat_items from threeview.patch.
- eval.py and eval_f.py: --exps "a;b" runs an explicit list of experiments (for example the 5pt+P3P+R+F
  control row '5p3v + R + C', or a few methods on one pinned core), and --tag X writes
  results/<scene>-X-<features>.json (focal_<scene>-X-... for eval_f.py), so extra runs never overwrite the
  main results files.

